      "title": "Powerhouse · Sydney dance-party flyers, 1990–1998",
      "url": "https://collection.powerhouse.com.au/object/539530",
      "kind": "Australian collection / curatorial account",
      "finding": "The David Travis collection contains 1,854 items. Flyers record local venues, promoters and changes in event communication.",
      "checked": "2026-10-29"
